Rwirec1 yc1 xc1 0.01
Dsc1 xc1 pc transistorD
Dac1 pc pos antiparallelD
Bswc2 0 yc2 I=V(0,yc2)*1e-6*exp(18.42068074395*V(gc2))
Rwirec2 yc2 xc2 0.01
